AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]staged rollout.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]ctrl_shift_p_task_card.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/ctrl_shift_p_task_card.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-42[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-42/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Repair refresh rendering and establish a real modal harness[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]repair-refresh[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]repair-refresh: fix the confirmed malformed footer crash, verify the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decay card's Less often path, and ship the independent patch before the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]trial.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plan card actions and frozen priority previews[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]card-model[dim] · [dim][/dim]after repair-refresh[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]card-model: add pure context-aware card and key models with independent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-target priority previews, availability reasons, and table tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render the compact Task Card and its accessible visual states[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]card-view[dim] · [dim][/dim]after card-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]card-view: add the task header, recommendation timeline, priority strip,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stable action rows, theme-native styles, and permanent classic search [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mode.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Connect safe keyboard actions and synchronous linked-task [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]shells[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]card-dispatch[dim] · [dim][/dim]after card-view[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]card-dispatch: route card gestures through existing stages and writers, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]guarantee immediate focus and safe asynchronous resolution, and add a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pilot setting.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add concise date input and inline scheduling reasons[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]schedule-input[dim] · [dim][/dim]after card-dispatch[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]schedule-input: extend date input with bare day offsets, unsigned units,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]weekdays, exact previews, inline reasons, and Shift+Enter reason [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]skipping.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Combine scheduling reason and Work Log review[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]schedule-review[dim] · [dim][/dim]after schedule-input[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]schedule-review: replace serial reason and work-summary prompts with one[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]optional review while preserving every existing per-target log rule and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writer.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Verify full parity and prepare the dated default rollout[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]parity-rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after schedule-review[/#AF87FF]